                        <hi rendition="#italic">British and Foreign, State Papers</hi>, vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, p. 703.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d18-f3" n="15" xml:id="d18-f3-content">
                <p>Frank le Sage de Fontenay, Danish Minister in Iceland.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
